  description: The host's undertaker, promoted for enthusiasm. His work keeps getting
    back up, which he takes as a compliment.
  tactics: 'Summons CURSED help: Gravediggers early (their deaths slow you), Martyrs
    late (their deaths weaken you). Fire discipline is the fight - every add you
    reflex-kill hands him your legs or your sword. Red bolts hunt between waves of
    help.'
